<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bond futures end at record high.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bond futures end at record high.</headline>
<text>
<p>1650 GMT - Bonds end on high note, with futures at record, on mounting optimism over Portugal's EMU entry. Cash spread with Bunds could narrow below 80 basis points, traders say.</p>
<p>*June 97 up 53 basis points at 109.07</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 100.73 vs 100.35. 6.52 vs 6.57</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -4 bps vs -9 bps</p>
</text>
